  "Posted 5 August 2001 with no Coruscant-set cards (the strategy says 'I can't wait until Coruscant is out' and lists post-Coruscant replacements that are not part of the list), so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Start (6)': ISB Operations / Empire's Sinister Agents, Coruscant, Prepared Defenses, Imperial Decree, Secret Plans and You Cannot Hide Forever; these count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'Coruscant' dested the pre-Coruscant Dark system Coruscant (Dark) (Special Edition); 'Hoth' and 'Hoth Defensive Perimeter' dested the Dark pages Hoth (Dark) and Hoth: Defensive Perimeter (3rd Marker) (Dark).",
  "The '(ISB Agent)', '(Spy)' and '(Nighttime Droid)' tags after character names are the author's notes, not part of the card names; Admiral Ozzel (dropped by the draft) is restored. Posted 'DVDLOTS' dested Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'Vader W/Saber' dested Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'Devestator' dested Devastator; 'Vader's Saber' and 'Mara's Saber' dested Vader's Lightsaber and Mara Jade's Lightsaber.",
  "The strategy says the deck is 7-0 in tournament play (no event named).",
